==English==

===Etymology===
* Originated 1915-1920; after [[Daiquirí]], a town on the East coast of [[Cuba]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈdækəri/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
# A [[cocktail]] of [[rum]], [[lemon]] or [[lime]] juice and [[sugar]], sometimes with [[fruit]] added.

